            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Water quality",
              "heading_style": "title",
              "icon": "mdi:water-check"
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "**Live from the controller**\n\n| | Now | Target |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Temp** | {{ states('sensor.tank_monitor_water_temperature') }} °F | {{ states('number.tank_monitor_target_temperature') }} °F |\n| **TDS** | {{ states('sensor.tank_monitor_tds_1h_mean') }} ppm | informational |\n| **Light** | {{ states('sensor.tank_monitor_tank_light_level') }} lx | — |\n\n**Last manual test kit**\n\n| | Now | Target |\n|---|---|---|\n| **pH** | {{ states('input_number.aquarium_ph_manual') }} | 7.0 – 7.5 |\n| **GH** | {{ states('input_number.aquarium_gh') }} ppm | {{ states('input_number.aquarium_gh_target_min') }} – {{ states('input_number.aquarium_gh_target_max') }} |\n| **KH** | {{ states('input_number.aquarium_kh') }} ppm | {{ states('input_number.aquarium_kh_target_min') }} – {{ states('input_number.aquarium_kh_target_max') }} |\n| **NH3** | {{ states('input_number.aquarium_total_ammonia') }} ppm | 0 |\n| **NO3** | {{ states('input_number.aquarium_nitrate') }} ppm | under 20 |\n\n*TDS is a trend, not a verdict — it is the sum of everything dissolved and cannot tell you whether the right minerals are there. GH and KH are what matter. pH floor is 7.0, set by the emerald dwarf danios.*"
            },
