            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Sensor verification",
              "heading_style": "title",
              "icon": "mdi:check-decagram"
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "{% set stale = 90 %}\n{% set tt = state_attr('input_datetime.verified_temperature_probe','timestamp') %}\n{% set dt = state_attr('input_datetime.verified_tds_probe','timestamp') %}\n{% set pt = state_attr('input_datetime.verified_ph_probe','timestamp') %}\n{% set td = ((now().timestamp() - tt) / 86400) | round(0) | int if tt else none %}\n{% set dd = ((now().timestamp() - dt) / 86400) | round(0) | int if dt else none %}\n{% set pd = ((now().timestamp() - pt) / 86400) | round(0) | int if pt else none %}\n| Sensor | Last checked | Against |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Temp** | {% if td is none %}🔴 never{% elif td <= stale %}🟢 {{ td }}d ago{% else %}🟠 {{ td }}d ago{% endif %} | reference thermometer |\n| **TDS** | {% if dd is none %}🔴 never{% elif dd <= stale %}🟢 {{ dd }}d ago{% else %}🟠 {{ dd }}d ago{% endif %} | 1413 µS/cm solution |\n| **pH** | {% if pd is none %}🔴 never{% elif pd <= stale %}🟢 {{ pd }}d ago{% else %}🟠 {{ pd }}d ago{% endif %} | pH 4.00 + 7.00 buffer |\n\n{% if td is none or dd is none or pd is none %}**A sensor has never been checked against a reference.** That is the state the Seneye was in for its whole life here — it read pH 0.45 low and nothing in this system could tell.\n\n{% elif [td, dd, pd] | max > stale %}**Something is over {{ stale }} days since its last check.** Probes drift; the point of this card is that you find out on your terms rather than during a crisis.\n\n{% else %}All three checked within {{ stale }} days.\n\n{% endif %}*Update the dates below when you actually verify one. A reading you cannot check is not more trustworthy than one you can — it is less, because it is wrong more confidently.*"
            },
            {
              "type": "entities",
              "entities": [
                {
                  "entity": "input_datetime.verified_temperature_probe",
                  "name": "Temperature"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "input_datetime.verified_tds_probe",
                  "name": "TDS"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "input_datetime.verified_ph_probe",
                  "name": "pH"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
